# QA (M1 Stage 1): the Erker as Zuckerschock, entered from the side. The
# start of qa_salzburg_relaxed_explorer (Zuckerschock from the first M-box)
# up to Z1; a running jump from Z1 towards the burger sign comes down with her
# feet already below the sign's top, so she passes through the one-way sign
# from the side, lands on the Erker's left wall (frame 2279) and walks into the
# Erker (2 Oblaten). Not a trap: with 32 px inside she jumps up through the
# sign and lands on it (frame 2411, y 98). Since D-038 the house above the
# sign is raised (4 tiles of air over the sign), so a normal jump from the
# sign carries her onto Z3 (frame 2523, y 98).
level  = salzburg
source = handwritten
expect = deaths=0 lives=3 state=playing oblaten>=46
expect = player_y<=98 player_y>=98 no_event=Died
